<title>THAILAND: Hyundai in $95 mln deal with Thai TPI.</title>
<headline>Hyundai in $95 mln deal with Thai TPI.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Propoxide, a unit of Thai Petrochemical Industry Plc, said on Friday it awarded a $95 million contract to South Korea's Hyundai Engineering Ltd to build and supply technology to its petrochemical plant.</p>
</text>
